        </div>
        <div class="shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
          <a href="#event" class="w-full md:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-linear-to-r from-sky-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-600 hover:to-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-md shadow-sky-500/20">
            <span>イベント詳細を見る</span>
